  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-M 611.10 Readmissions to the Secure Psychiatric Unit. Persons transferred to a mental health or developmental services DRF from the unit pursuant to RSA 622:48 who are transferred back to the unit shall be transferred under the provisions of He-M 611.\n\nSource. #7299, eff 5-25-00, EXPIRED: 5-25-08\n\nNew. #9229, EMERGENCY, eff 8-5-08, EXPIRES: 2-1-09; ss by #9371, eff 2-1-09, EXPIRED: 2-1-17\n\nNew. #12104, INTERIM, eff 2-14-17, EXPIRES: 8-13-17; ss by #12341, eff 7-25-17; renumbered by #13255 (formerly He-M 611.09)",
